WEBVTT

00:22:28.080 --> 00:22:31.306
And I just knew what
we needed to do to support her.

00:22:31.330 --> 00:22:35.780
And just on Friday, she sent me an email
saying how grateful she is

00:22:35.804 --> 00:22:37.405
for the support that she's gotten

00:22:37.429 --> 00:22:38.816
as she heads into this.

00:22:38.840 --> 00:22:42.205
Having that impact and knowing
that in sharing my story

00:22:42.229 --> 00:22:44.088
and in changing the way that I have

00:22:44.112 --> 00:22:48.677
that we could be part of her journey
that she's about to go through

00:22:48.701 --> 00:22:50.347
and that she feels that support --

00:22:50.371 --> 00:22:53.090
that's probably one of the
most important things for me.

00:22:53.114 --> 00:22:55.496
(Music)

00:22:55.520 --> 00:22:58.939
AG: Accenture is working to become
one of the most truly human companies

00:22:58.963 --> 00:23:00.376
in the digital age.